From: MahanHD <mahanheidari2003@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] arm: dts: amami: do not invert the touchscreen's x axis

The rhine dtsi sets touchscreen-inverted-x on the Synaptics controller,
which suits honami, and on amami mirrors every touch left to right.
0001 used to drop it in the shared dtsi, changing honami too; drop it
for amami only.

---
--- a/arch/arm/boot/dts/qcom/qcom-msm8974-sony-xperia-rhine-amami.dts
+++ b/arch/arm/boot/dts/qcom/qcom-msm8974-sony-xperia-rhine-amami.dts
@@ -975,3 +975,13 @@
 	};
 };
 
+
+&touchscreen {
+	rmi4-f11@11 {
+		/*
+		 * The shared rhine dtsi inverts X, which suits honami; on amami's
+		 * panel it mirrors every touch left to right.
+		 */
+		/delete-property/ touchscreen-inverted-x;
+	};
+};
